                "title": "Skylab Leverset",
                "description": "The Omnia 364 Skylab Leverset has a circular rose with a contemporary lever. Easy to install, the Omnia 364 Lever will cover 2-1/8 inch bore door holes. It is available in your choice of modern finishes. The Solid Brass Skylab Door Lever will fit 1-3/8 inch, 1-3/4 inch, or 2 inch door thicknesses with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n",
                "keywords": "OMN-364/00. Contemporary Door Lever Latchsets, contemporary leversets, modern door hardware, Omnia 364 Contemporary Door Levers, Omnia contemporary levers, modern levers, Modern Style Door Levers, solid brass door levers, passage levers, privacy levers, dummy levers, ada compliant levers, Skylab Lever with Round Roses, Modern Skylab Levers, Skylab Leversets,"
